<title>USA: Caribbean Cigar introduces new products.</title>
<headline>Caribbean Cigar introduces new products.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, OHIO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caribbean Cigar Co said on Friday it recently introduced a series of new products at a show held in Cincinnati.</p>
<p>The company, headquartered in Miami, received positive reception from retailers through open purchase orders for approximately 700,000 cigars, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Carribean Cigar Co manufactures and distributes several cigar brands.</p>
</text>
